# Recordings are build output, not source.
#
# They are reproducible from the code in this folder plus `npm run record`, and
# versioning them is expensive: 17 clips x ~5MB, rewritten on every re-record,
# took this repo's .git to 348MB before the history was rewritten to strip them.
#
# Publish them as release assets or to a bucket instead of committing them.
*.webm
*.mp4
*.m4a
*.wav
*.mp3
!.gitignore
RECORD_RESULTS.json
RESULT_DIFF.json
RESULT_DIFF.md
